Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[" Section 6.3", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"da293e2c-2f8a-482f-a758-cc89cf60cd3d"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["  The struggle for life, part II",
 FontWeight->"Bold"]], "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"c9af8681-a70b-45de-a95b-\
64d491c1ba75"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction: (Predator-Prey)", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d339e65f-bfa1-423a-8101-41f7124ff09f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In Section 4.3 we considered the predator-prey problem.  In that section we \
developed a quadratic model that described the rate of growth for both the \
predator population and prey population.  A more satisfactory model should \
take into account the idea that even though the predator eats as much as it \
can find when food is scarce, it is not unreasonable that during periods of \
abundance the predator satiates, and it then feeds at a maximum possible per \
capita rate \[Beta], independent of the number of available prey.  Let:\n\n\t\
Prey population = x1\n\tPredator population = x2\n\nA useful way of \
expressing this is to consider a term for the predator eating the prey of the \
form:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"-", " ", 
    StyleBox["\[Beta]",
     FontSize->12]}], "*", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
     RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], 
    RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", 
     RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}]],
  FontSize->16,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"2f5d3a73-24d5-40ec-a9bc-f298caa973bb"],
 "\n\nin which \[Alpha] is some positive constant.\n\nWhen the prey \
population x1 is small, then the term reduces to:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"-", " ", 
    StyleBox[
     FractionBox[
      StyleBox["\[Beta]",
       FontSize->12], 
      StyleBox["\[Alpha]",
       FontSize->12]],
     FontSize->12]}], "*", 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}],
    FontSize->12], 
   StyleBox["*",
    FontSize->12], 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}],
    FontSize->12]}]],
  FontSize->16,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"f7062498-f8ea-47a0-b177-9a1350231e70"],
 "\n\t\nWhich indicates that the predator consumes the prey based on the \
number of predator-prey\ninteractions.\n\nHowever, when the prey population \
x1 is large, then the expression reduces to:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"-", " ", 
    StyleBox["\[Beta]",
     FontSize->12]}], "*", 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}],
    FontSize->12]}]],
  FontSize->16,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"6747c3c7-fa16-4200-b837-496039ea4e45"],
 "\n\nWhich indicates that the predator consumes only as much food as is \
needed.\n\nThe ",
 StyleBox["prey", "Subsubsection"],
 StyleBox[" population", "Subsubsection"],
 " is assumed to grow logistically, with a maximum population of k:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["r",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], "*", 
   RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "k"]}], ")"}]}]],
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"dafb145b-741a-4a0f-b7f8-87c9dc789136"],
 "\n\nTherefore, the conservation based ODE that represents the rate of \
growth (positive or negative) of the prey is:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"x1", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"r", "*", 
      RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "-", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "k"]}], ")"}]}], " ", "-", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{" ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Beta]", "*", 
        RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
        RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}], 
      RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", 
       RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}]}],
   FontWeight->"Bold"]],ExpressionUUID->
  "974816bc-6704-464a-b2d2-3dddc4173d03"],
 "\n\nThe ",
 StyleBox["predator", "Subsubsection"],
 " is assumed to grow logistically but with a maximum population limited to a \
fraction \[Nu] of the prey population:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"s", "*", 
   RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     StyleBox[
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], 
       RowBox[{"\[Nu]", "*", 
        RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]],
      FontSize->18]}], ")"}]}]],
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"6a16bdec-d087-47c8-ae89-56217de20074"],
 "\n\nTherefore, the conservation based ODE that represents the rate of \
growth of predator is:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"x2", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"s", "*", 
     RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], 
        RowBox[{"\[Nu]", "*", 
         RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}], ")"}]}]}],
   FontWeight->"Bold"]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b6363f10-a924-4666-9e49-727a42a735cb"],
 "\n"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"37c3e071-0bb1-48f4-b0e0-cad9ba091d82"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Solution
Maximum prey population:\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"28ee59be-ed09-4b3e-b357-81d25bf3f633"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{" ", 
  RowBox[{"Remove", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", " ", "]"}], " "}]], "InputOnly",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.3985392651404305`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[56]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8c51b7ed-734c-4c88-b613-b3ce8e6a6a51"],

Cell["First, solve for the equilibrium points:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"99b28e0d-ae30-4555-adcd-31f98d8c41f2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Solve", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"0", "\[Equal]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"r", " ", 
         RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", "-", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "k"]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"\[Beta]", " ", 
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], 
         RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", 
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"0", "\[Equal]", 
       RowBox[{"s", " ", 
        RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "-", 
          FractionBox[
           RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], 
           RowBox[{"\[Nu]", " ", 
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}], ")"}]}]}]}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], 
  "//", "TableForm"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985393018591805`*^9, 3.3985393050623055`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[57]:=",ExpressionUUID->"91ad781f-7f5f-47de-9ee8-20ddef00894b"],

Cell["\<\
Observe that this problem allows the possibility of three different \
equilibrium points.  The first corresponds to no predator, and therefore the \
prey population assumes its maximum value of k.

The second equilibrium point will be negative, and therefore does not \
correspond to a physical solution.

The third equilibrium point will be positive, and represents a non-trivial \
equilibrium condition for the predator and prey populations.

\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9a53b575-6d64-42a3-8a3f-9c6a4786fb80"],

Cell["\<\
The precise nature of the predator-prey solution depends directly upon the \
values that are specified for the model.  In what follows, I have chosen \
specific values (that are reasonable) which allow for the predator-prey model \
to generate a limit cycle:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a520d8fe-9f31-410f-8418-df7f8cd517bc"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"r", "=", ".1"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"k", "=", "2300"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "=", "100"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[Beta]", "=", "1."}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"s", "=", ".05"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\[Nu]", "=", ".13"}], ";"}], "\t\t"}]}], "InputOnly",
 CellLabel->"In[58]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d35f66ae-9ee0-479d-95f1-a15b9d136f1d"],

Cell["Determine the equilibrium points for the specific values:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7ee5ed02-30e3-44a5-aa12-86b1dc242c86"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"eqPoints", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"Solve", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"0", "\[Equal]", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"r", " ", 
           RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", "-", 
             FractionBox[
              RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "k"]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
          FractionBox[
           RowBox[{"\[Beta]", " ", 
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], 
           RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", 
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"0", "\[Equal]", 
         RowBox[{"s", " ", 
          RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
            FractionBox[
             RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], 
             RowBox[{"\[Nu]", " ", 
              RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}], ")"}]}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  "\n"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"TableForm", "[", "eqPoints", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.3985391579998055`*^9, {3.3985393302498055`*^9, 3.3985393472654305`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[64]:=",ExpressionUUID->"770d5caa-716f-4253-92bb-4d00130f7a76"],

Cell["Graph the non-negative equilibrium points:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"86ddd46b-207b-4d2e-ae11-b5bae8b976ce"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"graph1", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"Show", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Graphics", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"PointSize", "[", ".03", "]"}], ",", "Red", ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Point", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], "/.", 
         "\[InvisibleSpace]", "eqPoints"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", "k"}], "}"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", 
           RowBox[{".02", " ", "k"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Frame", "\[Rule]", "True"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], 
    ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"FrameLabel", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<x1\>\"", ",", "\"\<x2\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", "2500"}], "}"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "10"}], ",", "140"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", ".6"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985393759216805`*^9, 3.3985394088904305`*^9}, 
   3.3985394820466805`*^9, {3.3985395140310555`*^9, 3.3985395156560555`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[66]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3c5359f1-3cbb-4325-801d-8a6d8504d027"],

Cell["\<\
Next, plot the vector field corresponding to our predator-prey ODEs:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aeee7948-1e47-4d15-aa84-6e74c7a23c5a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"graph2", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"VectorPlot", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"r", " ", "x1", " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "-", 
          FractionBox["x1", "k"]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"\[Beta]", " ", "x1", " ", "x2"}], 
        RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", "x1"}]]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"s", " ", "x2", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         FractionBox["x2", 
          RowBox[{"\[Nu]", " ", "x1"}]]}], ")"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x1", ",", "100", ",", "2500"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x2", ",", "0", ",", "130"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"VectorScale", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{".02", ",", "2", ",", "None"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"Frame", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", "0.6"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"FrameLabel", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<x1\>\"", ",", "\"\<x2\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985391875154305`*^9, 3.3985391912810555`*^9}, {
  3.3985394328435555`*^9, 3.3985394702341805`*^9}, {3.4667724314432325`*^9, 
  3.466772448739775*^9}, {3.466772543769201*^9, 3.4667726434704113`*^9}, {
  3.751030598161318*^9, 3.751030675811318*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[70]:=",ExpressionUUID->"84f82135-036a-46ac-9ce9-9720875838d9"],

Cell["\<\
The above vector field clearly indicates that the predator-prey populations \
will cycle back and forth.

Superimpose the equilibrium points onto the vector field:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"77ed3738-c9eb-4e1c-a73f-74172d626704"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Show", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
  "graph2", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "graph1", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "2500"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "10"}], ",", "140"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[71]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3d93c962-de6c-4985-8b09-d9c780333553"],

Cell["\<\
The above graph clearly indicates that the populations will cycle only about \
the non-trivial equilibrium point.  However, it is difficult to tell if this \
equilibrium point is stable or unstable.  We could continue to refine the \
vector field, however it is easier in this case to consider the behavior of a \
specific solution.

Consider a solution that starts with the prey at its maximum population k = \
2300 and exactly one predator:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"12a77278-b301-4c6d-b4dd-7d799d087196"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"tStop", "=", "4000"}], ";"}]], "InputOnly",
 CellLabel->"In[72]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6538fbac-a10a-4853-bd45-5bbb306a358c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"solutionRules", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"NDSolve", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["x1", "\[Prime]",
         MultilineFunction->None], "[", "t", "]"}], "\[Equal]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"r", " ", 
         RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", "-", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "k"]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"\[Beta]", " ", 
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], 
         RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", 
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["x2", "\[Prime]",
         MultilineFunction->None], "[", "t", "]"}], "\[Equal]", 
       RowBox[{"s", " ", 
        RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "-", 
          FractionBox[
           RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], 
           RowBox[{"\[Nu]", " ", 
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x1", "[", "0", "]"}], "\[Equal]", "2300"}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x2", "[", "0", "]"}], "\[Equal]", "1"}]}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"t", ",", "0", ",", "tStop"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"MaxSteps", "\[Rule]", "3000"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985395335310555`*^9, 3.3985395369216805`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[73]:=",ExpressionUUID->"54cf9ed0-2620-4b07-8da9-a76e2ab61cb0"],

Cell["Graph the solution:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8db3675b-747c-410d-9ce5-80cd4e5ebd99"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"graph3", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"ParametricPlot", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], "/.", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "solutionRules", "]"}]}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"t", ",", "0", ",", "tStop"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", "All"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"PlotPoints", "\[Rule]", "1000"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"AxesLabel", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<x1\>\"", ",", "\"\<x2\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", "0.6"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985395446873055`*^9, 3.3985396090310555`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[74]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ba481281-d2b3-4a0d-b2f7-2ec87a642cf1"],

Cell["\<\
Observe that the solution approaches a limit cycle from the outside.

Superimpose this graph onto the equilibrium points and vector field:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e92c154-4e3e-4494-a7b4-1947ab59a551"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Show", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
  "graph2", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "graph1", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "graph3", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "2500"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "10"}], ",", "140"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[75]:=",ExpressionUUID->"31dfa6af-2171-4c2b-a490-984f84dbb3d8"],

Cell["\<\
Observe that the limit cycle orbits about the non-trivial equilibrium point.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"43cb801c-2405-46e6-820a-74f700643de7"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Solution
Equilibrium predator-prey population:\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1cdaca64-0603-4751-bb2b-d32bfff02686"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"r", "=", ".1"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"k", "=", "2300"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "=", "100"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[Beta]", "=", "1."}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"s", "=", ".05"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\[Nu]", "=", ".13"}], ";"}], "\t\t"}]}], "InputOnly",
 CellLabel->"In[76]:=",ExpressionUUID->"df1e1452-d732-4876-9437-7126627ecd1a"],

Cell["\<\
Consider the case of starting with initial predator and prey populations \
close to the equilibrium conditions.  The corresponding vector field will be \
restricted to the region in the immediate vicinity of the equilibrium point.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8ac7acfe-065b-4534-8ba0-b9852aadef30"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"graph4", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"VectorPlot", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"r", " ", "x1", " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "-", 
          FractionBox["x1", "k"]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"\[Beta]", " ", "x1", " ", "x2"}], 
        RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", "x1"}]]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"s", " ", "x2", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         FractionBox["x2", 
          RowBox[{"\[Nu]", " ", "x1"}]]}], ")"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x1", ",", "100", ",", "600"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x2", ",", "0", ",", "70"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"VectorScale", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{".02", ",", "2", ",", "None"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"Frame", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", "0.6"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"FrameLabel", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<x1\>\"", ",", "\"\<x2\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985396373591805`*^9, 3.3985396582810555`*^9}, {
  3.4667727082972918`*^9, 3.466772739531067*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[82]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b1d5c4e0-7acf-4c4d-a640-5c99c7116a69"],

Cell["Superimpose the vector field over the equilibrium point.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e9b68f55-2894-4b6c-8c51-a3190d727664"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Show", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
  "graph4", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "graph1", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"50", ",", "650"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "75"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[83]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b0c1829a-f073-44f7-ac48-c0e4a8b3a1a4"],

Cell["\<\
Solve the predator-prey conservation ODEs starting with initial conditions \
very close to the equilibrium point.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"656336a3-e0e1-4ce6-aadc-206376194629"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"tStop", "=", "4000"}], ";"}]], "InputOnly",
 CellLabel->"In[84]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ee6a144d-ffd3-4d57-b146-933be6ab90f8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"solutionRules", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"NDSolve", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["x1", "\[Prime]",
         MultilineFunction->None], "[", "t", "]"}], "\[Equal]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"r", " ", 
         RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", "-", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "k"]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"\[Beta]", " ", 
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], 
         RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", 
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["x2", "\[Prime]",
         MultilineFunction->None], "[", "t", "]"}], "\[Equal]", 
       RowBox[{"s", " ", 
        RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "-", 
          FractionBox[
           RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], 
           RowBox[{"\[Nu]", " ", 
            RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x1", "[", "0", "]"}], "\[Equal]", "226"}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x2", "[", "0", "]"}], "\[Equal]", "31"}]}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"t", ",", "0", ",", "tStop"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]",
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"MaxSteps", "\[Rule]", "3000"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985396831091805`*^9, 3.3985396842341805`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[85]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d2519109-8ff5-4a7d-a867-1976effbba91"],

Cell["Plot the solution:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9ad0f512-1b73-4bd2-ac78-f3ac314272be"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"graph5", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"ParametricPlot", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], "/.", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "solutionRules", "]"}]}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"t", ",", "0", ",", "tStop"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", "All"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"PlotPoints", "\[Rule]", "1000"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"AxesOrigin", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", "0.6"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"AxesLabel", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<x1\>\"", ",", "\"\<x2\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985396895466805`*^9, 3.3985397266248055`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[86]:=",ExpressionUUID->"37baad79-b9a3-4878-b230-c142b002ec0c"],

Cell["\<\
Observe that the above solution will spiral outward to a limit cycle.  This \
indicates (at least for this predator-prey model and specific model \
coefficients) that:

\t the equilibrium point is unstable
\t the predator and prey populations will always fluctuate.

Superimpose this solution onto the vector field and equilibrium point:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"81972ffc-de16-4fe0-b4e3-599aaccb2aa3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Show", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
  "graph4", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "graph1", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "graph5", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"50", ",", "650"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "75"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[87]:=",ExpressionUUID->"2ec8234a-81b2-4d63-bd58-e3bb7e6e5de3"],

Cell["\<\

Finally, examine both solutions and the equilibrium points:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4749bbaf-fa3a-4d2d-a37f-448227e86f0d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Show", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
  "graph3", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "graph1", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "graph5", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "2500"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "10"}], ",", "140"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[88]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f0d20813-959e-48da-b6ff-ba12b0cf48e2"],

Cell["\<\
Observe that the same limit cycle will be approached from either the outside \
or the inside.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fd410f9d-39cc-4d2a-880e-d02364478f3a"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Example of Parameter \[Alpha]:", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c2b17808-2528-4121-82d0-b4c72da5570e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{" ", 
  RowBox[{"Remove", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", " ", "]"}], " "}]], "InputOnly",
 CellLabel->"In[89]:=",ExpressionUUID->"762a6026-86ca-4be8-bbdf-bef2f6415686"],

Cell["\<\
Although the above predator-prey model has a number of different parameters, \
we will illustrate the influence of the parameter \[Alpha] on the model's \
behavior.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fe948733-0d3e-4b63-8fa5-91a0f6398f5a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The following system of ODEs generates an example of a limit cycle in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["R", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2d58b9bc-99c2-45c7-8a93-5acc6b4dfc41"],
 " that comes and goes as a function of a parameter \[Alpha].\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"     ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"x1", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], "==", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"r", "*", 
       RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "k"]}], ")"}]}], " ", "-", 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{" ", 
        RowBox[{"\[Beta]", "*", 
         RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
         RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}], 
       RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", 
        RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"x2", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], "==", 
     RowBox[{"s", "*", 
      RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "-", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], 
         RowBox[{"\[Nu]", "*", 
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}], ")"}]}]}]}]}]],
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"612919e4-c9ab-46d7-b2cd-22ee89987d5c"],
 "\n\t"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"57ea1aae-224e-4c6d-ae40-58fa987ebc63"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"r", "=", ".1"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"k", "=", "2300"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[Beta]", "=", "1."}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"s", "=", ".05"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\[Nu]", "=", ".13"}], ";"}], "\t\t"}]}], "InputOnly",
 CellLabel->"In[90]:=",ExpressionUUID->"960eb88a-5b54-4a3c-b0d4-f1a99023bee4"],

Cell["\<\

In order to visualize the influence of the parameter \[Alpha] on the solution \
orbits, define a function whose argument is the parameter \[Alpha]:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ff15c3a3-66dd-4436-a92f-7cac9bd1e5e0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"displayOrbit", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "\[Alpha]_", ",", "x1Min_", ",", "x1Max_", ",", "x2Min_", ",", "x2Max_"}], 
   "]"}], ":=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"tStop", "=", "4000"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"solutionRules", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"NDSolve", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox["x1", "\[Prime]",
             MultilineFunction->None], "[", "t", "]"}], "\[Equal]", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"r", " ", 
             RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"1", "-", 
               FractionBox[
                RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], "k"]}], ")"}]}], "-", 
            FractionBox[
             RowBox[{"\[Beta]", " ", 
              RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
              RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], 
             RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", "+", 
              RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}]}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox["x2", "\[Prime]",
             MultilineFunction->None], "[", "t", "]"}], "\[Equal]", 
           RowBox[{"s", " ", 
            RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"1", "-", 
              FractionBox[
               RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}], 
               RowBox[{"\[Nu]", " ", 
                RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}]}]]}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"x1", "[", "0", "]"}], "\[Equal]", "226"}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"x2", "[", "0", "]"}], "\[Equal]", "31"}]}], 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"t", ",", "0", ",", "tStop"}], "}"}], ",", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"MaxSteps", "\[Rule]", "4000"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
     "ParametricPlot", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"x1", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x2", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], "/.", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
        "solutionRules"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"t", ",", "0", ",", "tStop"}], "}"}], ",", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"AspectRatio", "\[Rule]", "1"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"Frame", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"PlotRange", "\[Rule]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"x1Min", ",", "x1Max"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"x2Min", ",", "x2Max"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"PlotPoints", "\[Rule]", "50"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"Epilog", "\[Rule]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"PointSize", "[", ".03", "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Point", "[", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"226", ",", "31"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Text", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<\[Alpha] = \>\"", ",", "\[Alpha]"}], "}"}], "]"}], 
            ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"x1Min", "+", 
               RowBox[{".85", 
                RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{"x1Max", "-", "x1Min"}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"x2Min", "+", 
               RowBox[{".1", 
                RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{"x2Max", "-", "x2Min"}], ")"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}], 
           "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"PerformanceGoal", "\[Rule]", "\"\<Quality\>\""}]}], 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "]"}]}]], "InputOnly",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985392473904305`*^9, 3.3985392556404305`*^9}, 
   3.3985397833591805`*^9, {3.3985408540623055`*^9, 3.3985408556248055`*^9}, {
   3.3985410787029305`*^9, 3.3985410799685555`*^9}, {3.3985411249841805`*^9, 
   3.3985411513904305`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[95]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5a1f9197-f1c8-4fa9-bc67-f59180bce935"],

Cell["Recall that the value of \[Alpha] used above was 100:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dbb51cb5-18a5-4d37-8533-82f79f6b1d92"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"displayOrbit", "[", 
  RowBox[{"100", ",", "0", ",", "600", ",", "10", ",", "60"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[96]:=",ExpressionUUID->"aafb8095-733a-4814-a5c1-39512e0ce45c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Consider the following range of values for the parameter: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"60", "\[LessEqual]", "\[Alpha]", "\[LessEqual]", "400"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"f9168021-dc72-4742-b6b4-ade3098cd0a0"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985409920779305`*^9, 
  3.3985410117341805`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9f6ef6d3-5765-4d37-b21c-\
61c99afb303a"],

Cell["\<\
Generate a sequence of plots that illustrates the orbit behavior for the \
above values of the parameter \[Alpha]:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a80df492-fbd6-4c9b-b6f6-a6893a03b51b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Manipulate", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"displayOrbit", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ",", "0", ",", "800", ",", "10", ",", "70"}], "]"}], 
   ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ",", "60", ",", "400"}], "}"}]}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3985398053123055`*^9, 3.3985398181091805`*^9}, {
   3.3985398945779305`*^9, 3.3985399074998055`*^9}, {3.3985399530466805`*^9, 
   3.3985399537654305`*^9}, 3.3985409071716805`*^9, {3.3985409437029305`*^9, 
   3.3985409734529305`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[97]:=",ExpressionUUID->"60c4bfa5-86ca-46ab-9f3f-437a28a88ec2"],

Cell["\<\
Observe that for values of \[Alpha] slightly larger than 100, that the \
equilibrium point (which is shifting slightly) changes from an unstable \
equilibrium point (with a stable limit cycle) to a stable equilibrium point.  \
Therefore the model has experienced a bifurcation as a function of the \
parameter \[Alpha].\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dd99d205-6003-4ac0-9a83-f5595db33d4d"]
}, Closed]]
}, Open  ]]
},
